nating feature (e.g., side, location) and design verification steps that specifically test that feature.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the discriminating feature (e.g., left vs right) using an independent localization or marker-based check before finalizing.\",\n    \"Ensure the chosen answer is backed by coordinate-level or grounded evidence, not just a single model's textual assertion.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":590,"total_tokens":979,"completion_tokens":389,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":590},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":389}}}